  "kind": "quirk",
  "title": "COTH returns #DIV/0! at 0, evaluates RN53(RN64(1/TANH(x))), and saturates large |x| to +/-1",
  "statement": "In Excel 16.0 build 20430, COTH(x) returns #DIV/0! at x = 0, computes the stored x87 reciprocal 1 / TANH(x) over the published TANH composition, and saturates large |x| (where TANH(x) reaches +/-1, including |x| = 1e15) to sign(x) (+/-1) without rejecting large circular arguments. Of 40,241 full-bank COTH rows, 40,238 match and 3 differ by at most 2 ULP.",
